# Field table: Nasdaq OUCH 5.0 (public specification, "Updated October, 2025",
# revision 1.05 of 10/7/2025, 26 pages), the order-entry messages carried in
# SoupBinTCP 3.0 Unsequenced Data (to Nasdaq) and Sequenced Data (from Nasdaq)
# packets. The SoupBinTCP packet length frames each message, so there is no
# length prefix here; the session layer is global_connectivity/non_certified/market_data/nasdaq/soupbintcp.tbl.
#
# Citations: (OUCH 5.0 <section>, p.<PDF page>); the PDF page numbers equal the
# printed footers.
#
# Data types (OUCH 5.0 1.2, p.3): Alpha is left-justified and padded on the
# right with spaces; numeric fields are big-endian binary; prices are unsigned
# with 4 implied decimals. The spec names numeric fields Integer, Numeric,
# UserRefNum, Price and Timestamp; all are unsigned big-endian here.
#
# Optional Appendage: a sequence of TagValue elements (Length 1, OptionTag 1,
# OptionValue variable; OUCH 5.0 1.2, p.4; options in Appendix A, pp.21-23).
# It is kept as an opaque trailing field. On the outbound messages whose
# section says "Appendage Length and Optional Appendage fields are both
# optional and will be absent unless ... non zero userRefIdx" (C, D, B, J, P,
# I, T, M, Q), both fields are one trailing field, AppendageWithLength, which
# is empty when they are absent and otherwise starts with the 2-byte length.
@venue nasdaq
@endian big
@pad space
@type Alpha char
@type UserRefNum uint
@type Integer uint
@type Numeric uint
@type Price uint
@type Timestamp uint
@type TagValue bytes
@type Options bytes

### ouch::to_nasdaq

MessageType O 0 1 # EnterOrder: new order (OUCH 5.0 2.1, pp.4-5)
UserRefNum UserRefNum 1 4 # Day-unique and strictly increasing per OUCH account (or per UserRefIdx channel)
Side Alpha 5 1 # B buy, S sell, T sell short, E sell short exempt
Quantity Integer 6 4 # Total shares; greater than zero and less than 1,000,000 (spec type "Interger")
Symbol Alpha 10 8 # Stock symbol
Price Price 18 8 # 4 implied decimals; max $199,999.9900; 0x7FFFFFFF = market (for a cross)
TimeInForce Alpha 26 1 # 0 Day, 3 IOC, 5 GTX (extended hours), 6 GTT (needs ExpireTime), E after hours
Display Alpha 27 1 # Y visible, N hidden, A attributable
Capacity Alpha 28 1 # A agency, P principal, R riskless, O other
InterMarketSweepEligibility Alpha 29 1 # Y eligible, N not eligible
CrossType Alpha 30 1 # N continuous, O opening, C closing, H halt/IPO, S supplemental, R retail (BX), E extended life, A after hours close
ClOrdID Alpha 31 14 # Customer order identifier; not checked for day-uniqueness
AppendageLength Integer 45 2 # Length of the Optional Appendage that follows
OptionalAppendage TagValue 47 # TagValue elements (Appendix A)

MessageType U 0 1 # ReplaceOrderRequest: cancel and replace in one message (OUCH 5.0 2.2, pp.6-7)
OrigUserRefNum UserRefNum 1 4 # UserRefNum of the Enter Order or of the last Replace Order
UserRefNum UserRefNum 5 4 # New UserRefNum for the replacement; unique and strictly increasing
Quantity Integer 9 4 # Total shares liable for the whole chain, including earlier executions
Price Price 13 8 # Price of the replacement
TimeInForce Alpha 21 1 # 0 Day, 3 IOC, 5 GTX, 6 GTT
Display Alpha 22 1 # Y visible, N hidden, A attributable
InterMarketSweepEligibility Alpha 23 1 # Y eligible, N not eligible
ClOrdID Alpha 24 14 # Customer order identifier for the replacement
AppendageLength Integer 38 2 # Length of the Optional Appendage that follows
OptionalAppendage Options 40 # TagValue elements (Appendix A); Firm and GroupID are inherited

MessageType X 0 1 # CancelOrderRequest: cancel or reduce an order (OUCH 5.0 2.3, pp.7-8)
UserRefNum UserRefNum 1 4 # UserRefNum of the order as entered
Quantity Integer 5 4 # New intended order size; 0 cancels all remaining shares
AppendageLength Integer 9 2 # Optional on this message; sent as 0 here
OptionalAppendage TagValue 11 # UserRefIdx only

MessageType M 0 1 # ModifyOrderRequest: change side or reduce without losing priority (OUCH 5.0 2.4, p.8)
UserRefNum UserRefNum 1 4 # UserRefNum of the order as entered
Side Alpha 5 1 # New side; only S to E, S to T, E to T allowed
Quantity Integer 6 4 # New intended order size
AppendageLength Integer 10 2 # Optional on this message
OptionalAppendage TagValue 12 # UserRefIdx, SharesLocated, LocateBroker

MessageType C 0 1 # MassCancelRequest: cancel booked orders matching the criteria (OUCH 5.0 2.5, p.9)
UserRefNum UserRefNum 1 4 # Day-unique and strictly increasing per order port
Firm Alpha 5 4 # Firm identifier, all caps
Symbol Alpha 9 8 # Optional, spaces if not specified
AppendageLength Integer 17 2 # 0 if no appendage follows
OptionalAppendage TagValue 19 # Side, Group ID, UserRefIdx

MessageType D 0 1 # DisableOrderEntryRequest: block new orders on the account (OUCH 5.0 2.6, pp.9-10)
UserRefNum UserRefNum 1 4 # Day-unique and strictly increasing per order port
Firm Alpha 5 4 # Firm identifier, all caps
AppendageLength Integer 9 2 # Length of the Optional Appendage that follows
OptionalAppendage TagValue 11 # UserRefIdx

MessageType E 0 1 # EnableOrderEntryRequest: unblock new orders on the account (OUCH 5.0 2.7, p.10)
UserRefNum UserRefNum 1 4 # Day-unique and strictly increasing per order port
Firm Alpha 5 4 # Firm identifier, all caps
AppendageLength Integer 9 2 # Length of the Optional Appendage that follows
OptionalAppendage TagValue 11 # UserRefIdx

MessageType Q 0 1 # AccountQueryRequest: ask for the next available UserRefNum (OUCH 5.0 2.8, p.10)
AppendageLength Integer 1 2 # Optional on this message; sent as 0 here
OptionalAppendage TagValue 3 # UserRefIdx

### ouch::from_nasdaq

MessageType S 0 1 # SystemEvent: start or end of day (OUCH 5.0 3.1, p.11)
@size 10
Timestamp Timestamp 1 8 # Nanoseconds since midnight
EventCode Alpha 9 1 # S start of day, E end of day

MessageType A 0 1 # OrderAccepted: the Enter Order was accepted (OUCH 5.0 3.2, pp.11-12)
Timestamp Timestamp 1 8 # Nanoseconds since midnight
UserRefNum UserRefNum 9 4 # As entered (spec spells it "UesrRefNum")
Side Alpha 13 1 # As entered
Quantity Integer 14 4 # Total shares accepted
Symbol Alpha 18 8 # As entered
Price Price 26 8 # Accepted price; better than or equal to the entered price
TimeInForce Alpha 34 1 # Accepted; equal to or shorter in scope than entered
Display Alpha 35 1 # Y visible, N hidden, A attributable, Z conformant
OrderReferenceNumber Numeric 36 8 # Day-unique order reference number assigned by Nasdaq
Capacity Alpha 44 1 # As specified
InterMarketSweepEligibility Alpha 45 1 # Y eligible, N not eligible
CrossType Alpha 46 1 # As entered
OrderState Alpha 47 1 # L live, D dead (accepted and automatically canceled; nothing further follows)
ClOrdID Alpha 48 14 # Customer order identifier
AppendageLength Integer 62 2 # Length of the Optional Appendage that follows
OptionalAppendage TagValue 64 # TagValue elements (Appendix A)

MessageType U 0 1 # OrderReplaced: the Replace Order was accepted (OUCH 5.0 3.3, pp.12-14)
Timestamp Timestamp 1 8 # Nanoseconds since midnight
OrigUserRefNum UserRefNum 9 4 # UserRefNum of the order replaced
UserRefNum UserRefNum 13 4 # UserRefNum of the replacement, as entered
Side Alpha 17 1 # As entered
Quantity Integer 18 4 # Total shares outstanding (on the book) after the replace
Symbol Alpha 22 8 # As entered
Price Price 30 8 # Accepted price of the replacement
TimeInForce Alpha 38 1 # Accepted time in force
Display Alpha 39 1 # Y visible, N hidden, A attributable, Z conformant
OrderReferenceNumber Numeric 40 8 # Day-unique order reference number assigned by Nasdaq
Capacity Alpha 48 1 # As specified
InterMarketSweepEligibility Alpha 49 1 # Y eligible, N not eligible
CrossType Alpha 50 1 # As entered
OrderState Alpha 51 1 # L live, D dead
ClOrdID Alpha 52 14 # Customer order identifier for the replacement
AppendageLength Numeric 66 2 # Length of the Optional Appendage that follows
OptionalAppendage Options 68 # TagValue elements (Appendix A)

MessageType C 0 1 # OrderCanceled: an order was reduced or canceled (OUCH 5.0 3.4, p.14)
Timestamp Timestamp 1 8 # Nanoseconds since midnight
UserRefNum UserRefNum 9 4 # UserRefNum of the order (partially) canceled
Quantity Numeric 13 4 # Shares decremented by this message; incremental, not cumulative
Reason Alpha 17 1 # Appendix B (the text says Appendix C)
AppendageWithLength TagValue 18 # Appendage Length (18, 2) and Optional Appendage (20); absent unless UserRefIdx was non-zero

MessageType D 0 1 # AIQCanceled: reduced by self-match prevention (OUCH 5.0 3.5, pp.14-15)
Timestamp Timestamp 1 8 # Nanoseconds since midnight
UserRefNum UserRefNum 9 4 # UserRefNum of the order reduced
DecrementShares Numeric 13 4 # Shares decremented by this message; incremental
Reason Alpha 17 1 # Always Q
QuantityPreventedFromTrading Integer 18 4 # Shares that would have executed
ExecutionPrice Price 22 8 # Price the trade would have had
LiquidityFlag Alpha 30 1 # Appendix D (the text says Appendix E)
AIQStrategy Alpha 31 1 # AIQ strategy used on the canceled order
AppendageWithLength TagValue 32 # Appendage Length (32, 2) and Optional Appendage (34); absent unless UserRefIdx was non-zero

MessageType E 0 1 # OrderExecuted: all or part of an order executed (OUCH 5.0 3.6, p.15)
Timestamp Timestamp 1 8 # Nanoseconds since midnight
UserRefNum UserRefNum 9 4 # UserRefNum of the order executed
Quantity Numeric 13 4 # Shares executed by this message; incremental
Price Price 17 8 # Execution price
LiquidityFlag Alpha 25 1 # Appendix D (the text says Appendix E)
MatchNumber Numeric 26 8 # Trade id; shared by the buy and the sell execution
AppendageLength Numeric 34 2 # Length of the Optional Appendage that follows
OptionalAppendage TagValue 36 # UserRefIdx

MessageType B 0 1 # BrokenTrade: an execution was broken (OUCH 5.0 3.7, p.16)
Timestamp Timestamp 1 8 # Nanoseconds since midnight
UserRefNum UserRefNum 9 4 # UserRefNum of the order whose execution is broken
MatchNumber Numeric 13 8 # Match Number of the Executed message broken
Reason Alpha 21 1 # E erroneous, C consent, S supervisory, X external
ClOrdID Alpha 22 14 # Customer order identifier
AppendageWithLength TagValue 36 # Appendage Length (36, 2) and Optional Appendage (38); absent unless UserRefIdx was non-zero

MessageType J 0 1 # Rejected: an Enter or Replace Order was rejected (OUCH 5.0 3.8, p.16)
Timestamp Timestamp 1 8 # Nanoseconds since midnight
UserRefNum UserRefNum 9 4 # UserRefNum of the order rejected; it cannot be reused
Reason Numeric 13 2 # Appendix C (the text says Appendix D)
ClOrdID Alpha 15 14 # Customer order identifier
AppendageWithLength TagValue 29 # Appendage Length (29, 2) and Optional Appendage (31); absent unless UserRefIdx was non-zero

MessageType P 0 1 # CancelPending: a cross order cannot be canceled until the cross completes (OUCH 5.0 3.9, p.17)
Timestamp Timestamp 1 8 # Nanoseconds since midnight
UserRefNum UserRefNum 9 4 # UserRefNum of the order
AppendageWithLength TagValue 13 # Appendage Length (13, 2) and Optional Appendage (15); absent unless UserRefIdx was non-zero

MessageType I 0 1 # CancelReject: a partial cancel of a cross order was refused (OUCH 5.0 3.10, p.17)
Timestamp Timestamp 1 8 # Nanoseconds since midnight
UserRefNum UserRefNum 9 4 # UserRefNum of the order
AppendageWithLength TagValue 13 # Appendage Length (13, 2) and Optional Appendage (15); absent unless UserRefIdx was non-zero

MessageType T 0 1 # OrderPriorityUpdate: the system changed the order's priority (OUCH 5.0 3.11, pp.17-18)
Timestamp Timestamp 1 8 # Nanoseconds since midnight
UserRefNum UserRefNum 9 4 # UserRefNum of the order
Price Price 13 8 # Limit price of the order
Display Alpha 21 1 # New display; Y anonymous, price to comply
OrderReferenceNumber Numeric 22 8 # New order reference number
AppendageWithLength TagValue 30 # Appendage Length (30, 2) and Optional Appendage (32); absent unless UserRefIdx was non-zero

MessageType M 0 1 # OrderModified: response to a Modify Order (OUCH 5.0 3.12, p.18)
Timestamp Timestamp 1 8 # Nanoseconds since midnight
UserRefNum UserRefNum 9 4 # UserRefNum of the order
Side Alpha 13 1 # Side as entered in the Modify Order
Quantity Numeric 14 4 # Total shares outstanding
AppendageWithLength TagValue 18 # Appendage Length (18, 2) and Optional Appendage (20); absent unless UserRefIdx was non-zero

MessageType R 0 1 # OrderRestated: the system modified the order (OUCH 5.0 3.13, pp.18-19)
Timestamp Timestamp 1 8 # Nanoseconds since midnight
UserRefNum UserRefNum 9 4 # UserRefNum of the order
Reason Alpha 13 1 # R refresh of display (reserves), P update of displayed price
AppendageLength Numeric 14 2 # Length of the Optional Appendage that follows
OptionalAppendage Options 16 # Display Quantity, Display Price, SecondaryOrdRefNum, UserRefIdx

MessageType X 0 1 # MassCancelResponse: a Mass Cancel Request was received (OUCH 5.0 3.14, p.19)
Timestamp Timestamp 1 8 # Nanoseconds since midnight
UserRefNum UserRefNum 9 4 # UserRefNum of the request
Firm Alpha 13 4 # Firm identifier
Symbol Alpha 17 8 # Spaces if not specified
AppendageLength Integer 25 2 # 0 if no appendage follows
OptionalAppendage TagValue 27 # Side, Group ID, UserRefIdx

MessageType G 0 1 # DisableOrderEntryResponse: a Disable Order Entry Request was received (OUCH 5.0 3.15, pp.19-20)
Timestamp Timestamp 1 8 # Nanoseconds since midnight
UserRefNum UserRefNum 9 4 # UserRefNum of the request
Firm Alpha 13 4 # Firm identifier
AppendageLength Integer 17 2 # Length of the Optional Appendage that follows
OptionalAppendage TagValue 19 # UserRefIdx

MessageType K 0 1 # EnableOrderEntryResponse: an Enable Order Entry Request was received (OUCH 5.0 3.16, p.20)
Timestamp Timestamp 1 8 # Nanoseconds since midnight
UserRefNum UserRefNum 9 4 # UserRefNum of the request
Firm Alpha 13 4 # Firm identifier
AppendageLength Integer 17 2 # Length of the Optional Appendage that follows
OptionalAppendage TagValue 19 # UserRefIdx

MessageType Q 0 1 # AccountQueryResponse: the next available UserRefNum (OUCH 5.0 3.17, p.20)
Timestamp Timestamp 1 8 # Nanoseconds since midnight
NextUserRefNum UserRefNum 9 4 # Next available UserRefNum
AppendageWithLength TagValue 13 # Appendage Length (13, 2) and Optional Appendage (15); absent unless UserRefIdx was non-zero

### end
